12", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314648_1477897313968445_426443042783417120_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BetOyALbHJcQ7kNvwGVGbPj&_nc_oc=AdrEHL9lMoZmxS7E7ceNd2foauMwuhu0ERXggI9uUQGgrtLX7AuheKwCdu6YmPWMnyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-9gIZaoLKI9C44-xfVc_a6wTIpd3psW-wgwszdxuV4dg&oe=6A412ECC"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot2.png", "id": "1461166165412321", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821194_1461166168745654_5440374780000579121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QrL1m-A2CCoQ7kNvwEgLJPg&_nc_oc=AdranE6FFnoYWLj0Khj3klNwSFd0PTipOaA_aigeo-zfYXYuCkHlUk8Ao1Le06KfQOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rn9V86Pohb9VRxOv9lW5-sY0I8hrnzAbHOOhOiHra9A&oe=6A4111BE"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "1475419777303291", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619148_1475419780636624_321223828696856386_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F6JaYVvOdrMQ7kNvwFfhi_8&_nc_oc=Adroaf6EsUW5VYTn7vmh-lUSQy_2XdTRxXmuCHBgAvLOHNEydKtOYhP_OU9NeNL1Kfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8_ZFcXo8CwWPOaIUmfG7N2Mrik7xHElgPx4AyqfvejMQ&oe=6A411A9B"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "2696429090738581", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_2696429094071914_4027493837046151170_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-1EBDamImQQ7kNvwGvnHn5&_nc_oc=Adq_XN0YCtpUlyxnNx7KuudB4GQ3c90Dpw81VSKmJ3yowRurCdyvJioF8QQ0ak7X45o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_KlR42wIb6vpJTH_gh3gZ1YteBUhFLV6LkCvQJMInnhA&oe=6A413689"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "2236750433728309", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820001_2236750437061642_7202580099581255007_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vz4wgo5ttqEQ7kNvwGPSUlE&_nc_oc=Adqdl5qeYZUpbkF-7GUEQxSCp3se1mpqxiB0IMBuA0I_tE8e1OSgz51iPtR1Lm1GtMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_IcqI-C-Ily7u-HU5JTBFSXTfCNeFRLX47lwlpf0ug2w&oe=6A411C40"}, "display_name": "Neon Pool", "keywords": ["Neon", "Pool", "Billiards", "eightball", "Elegant"], "long_description": "Neon Pool is an 8-ball Billiards game played on a billiard table with six pockets, cue sticks, and sixteen billiard balls (a cue ball and fifteen object balls). The object balls include seven solid-colored balls numbered 1 through 7, seven striped balls numbered 9 through 15, and the black 8 ball. After the balls are scattered with a break shot, a player is assigned either the group of solid or striped balls once they have legally pocketed a ball from that group. The object of the game is to legally pocket the 8-ball in a \"called\" pocket, which can only be done after all of the balls from a player's assigned group have been cleared from the table.\n\nThe game contains 4 levels of difficulty: Easy, Medium, Hard and Master, it can be played on Single Player as well as on Multiplayer mode.", "short_description": "Neon Pool is an 8-ball Billiards game with an elegant neon environment setup."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-06.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_proce